From d9dda48f8a7e182ed8c0f56e5fde9e367131a07a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moriyoshi Koizumi <moriyoshi@php.net>
Date: Fri, 12 Mar 2010 04:55:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] - Update the bundled libmbfl to the latest on upstream.

NOTE: this file is the ext/mbstring/libmbfl/mbfl/mbfilter.c HALF of that
commit, extracted from https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/d9dda48f8a7e.patch
(269619 bytes, 64 files, +3435 -4164; that file's own sha256 is recorded in
../spec.md). It is here because it is where the bound came BACK into
`mbfl_strcut` in 2010, four years and three months after cb3cca21b345 fixed the
caller -- see c/kernel_hardened.c. It is NOT this row's fix_commit.
---
